Aadhar and Citizen is one to one relationship. One citizen can have only one Aadhar.
Or any aadhar number uniquely identify a unique citizen.

One to One relationship is flexible. The mapping can be declary in any of the class
because it is a bidirectional relationship. Here we are going to declare Citizent is the
main table, so inside Aadhar table we are going to create reference of Citizen table.

We are not declering any dependency inside Citizen table.

We can create seperate object of Aadhar and Citizen and then can save separately.


